\cf0 30 Sep \'97 Chip escalates issues with Sarah & Hayley
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Strengthen Rotherhithe as Chip\'92s specific professional terror.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Five-disc concern; Chip\'92s Fridge Force authority; Sarah already knows about Rotherhithe.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Give Chip one concise reason for his fear: interacting stasis fields can couple and behave as one system; Rotherhithe proved the consequences can extend outside the nominal fields. Keep it brief.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No Eloise link. No military application. No remote targeting.\cell \row

