\f1\b \cf0 1 Oct \'97 Three Sisters discuss watching Eloise
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Seed that Hayley follows the Rotherhithe lead promptly.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Sarah asks Hayley to investigate Eloise; Hayley reveals she already does; no second Gyges project found.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Add a small indication that Hayley followed Chip\'92s warning and has read the public Rotherhithe material. She now understands why five interacting discs alarm him. Sarah broadens the brief to possible weapons conversion.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Hayley does not yet find the old Shakti project. Sarah does not yet connect dreams to field geometry.\cell \row

