\f1\b \cf0 25 Nov \'97 Hayley investigates Gyges Disks
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Full redraft. This becomes the first major historical escalation.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Current opening; zombie-corpse accountant sentence; Hayley searching beyond obvious Shakti projects; municipal/public-records flavour if it survives naturally.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Replace the weak \'93Chip had spent months\'85\'94 transition with Hayley deliberately going 
\f1\b beyond the public Rotherhithe story
\f0\b0 : she asks what Fridge Force research followed the collapse. That trail leads to the old Shakti project. Establish the move from damping interactions to deliberately manipulating them, Fridge Force intervention, plausible military application, Eloise\'92s appeal.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No proof of weapons development. No evidence of a secret successor project. No claim that Kebab is already reproducing this capability.\cell \row

