\f1\b \cf0 26 Nov \'97 Hayley reports to Sarah
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Draft largely from scratch. Split exposition between Hayley and Sarah.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Hayley\'92s competence; Sarah as an active security professional; holoscreen payoff.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Hayley brings copies on a pocket drive and refuses to load them onto Shakti systems. Sarah uses Janine\'92s antique holoscreen. Reveal ownership casually. Sarah interrogates the material and recognises a structural resemblance between historical phase/interference patterns and her increasingly coherent dreams.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Sarah cannot yet identify the dreams as targeting information. Eloise\'92s concealment is suspicious, not yet betrayal.\cell \row

