\f1\b \cf0 13 Dec \'97 Late Night Experiments
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Redraft to make historical concern begin appearing in current telemetry.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Existing experiment escalation if useful; increasing coherence; Chip\'92s safety concern.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Introduce small, arguable physical anomalies during high coherence: vibrations, strain readings, effects outside expected envelopes. Chip recognises the 
\f3\i class
\f0\i0  of behaviour from Rotherhithe. Sarah recognises increasing order in dream patterns.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No dramatic remote earthquake yet. No controlled locus. No confirmed weapon capability.\cell \row

