\f1\b \cf0 14 Dec \'97 Eloise Measures Risk
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Redraft around knowledge and choice.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Eloise\'92s intelligence, willingness to push research, ambiguity of motive.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Let Eloise privately recognise that Kebab may be entering territory related to the old Fridge Force work. She authorises further controlled testing because the evidence is inconclusive and communication is improving. This scene can give the 
\f1\b reader
\f0\b0 slightly more than Sarah.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Eloise should not openly discuss weaponisation or targeting. Do not make her a moustache-twirler.\cell \row

