\f1\b \cf0 23 Dec \'97 Missing Socks
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Major redraft. Make this the scientific triumph.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Five-disc resonance; genuine coherent communication; Missing Socks message; comic payoff.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Strip out most of the overt seismic escalation from the rough. Allow one local tremor or troubling anomaly. The important result is that coherence works and communication is real. Eloise therefore gains a powerful scientific defence.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Nobody yet knows about Gibson. Nobody intentionally targets an earthquake. No one declares \'93weapons test\'94.\cell \row

